Plain C++ versions of inline functions that the decomp writes in Gekko
assembly or paired-single intrinsics (psq_l/ps_madd/fres/frsqrte...).
clang for wasm32 cannot compile PowerPC asm, so each asm body gets a
`#ifndef __MWERKS__` twin computing the same result in scalar code.

